hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1861","Isma'il bin Abi Khalid ne apni taraf se riwayat ki hai ke unke baap ne unhein bataya ke Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنہ) ne unhein bataya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se kisi ki naukar ne uske liye khana tayyar karte hue garmi aur dhuein se sabr kiya ho...\"""""
"1862","Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \slam phylao\"""""
"1863","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \(Tum sab) Ar-Rahman ki ibadat karo.\"""""
"1864","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنهم) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Asha ka khana kha liya karo.\"""""
"1865","Hazrat Umar bin Abi Salamah (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke unhone Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hazoor mein dakhil honay par, jab aap ke paas khaana maujood tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Baith ja ae mere beta! Allah ka naam le (Bismillah parho) aur apne daayein haath se khaana khaao.\"""""
"1866","# Hadith ka Tarjumah\n\n**Qutaybah ibn Abī Rajā' ne hamari taraf se riwāyat kī, Jarīr ne riwāyat kī, 'Aṭā' ibn al-Sā'ib se, Sa'īd ibn Jubayr se, Ibn 'Abbās (raḍiya Allāhu 'anhumā) se, aur Nabī ﷺ ne farmāyā:**\n\n> *\Yaqīnan barakah khānay ke nazdīk (darmiyān) utartī hāi. Pas tum us ke kināron se khāo aur us ke darmiyān se mat khāo.\""*\n\nAbū 'Īsā (Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: **\""Yeh ḥasan ṣaḥīḥ hadith hai. Yeh sirf 'Aṭā' ibn al-Sā'ib ki riwāyat se ma'lūm hai. Shu'bah aur Thawrī ne dono ne 'Aṭā' ibn al-Sā'ib se riwāyat kī hai. Is bāb mein Ibn 'Umar (raḍiya Allāhu 'anhu) ki bhi riwāyat hai.\""**\n\n---\n\n### 'Ilmī Ḥawāle:\n\n- **Ḥasan Ṣaḥīḥ**: Tirmidhī ne is riwāyat ko *ḥasan* (achī) aur *ṣaḥīḥ* (mu'tabar) dono darjon mein rakha hai"," jo is ki mazboot isnād (silsila-e-riwāyat) ko zāhir karta hai.\n- **Ibn 'Abbās** (raḍiya Allāhu 'anhu): Nabī ﷺ ke cācāzād bhāi aur Qur'ān ke mash'ūr mufassir.\n- **Sa'īd ibn Jubayr**: Ek barhe tābi'ī aur Ibn 'Abbās ke ahamm shāgirdon mein se.\n- **'Aṭā' ibn al-Sā'ib**: Kūfah ke mash'ūr rāwī jin ki riwāyāt barhe muḥaddisīn ne zabt kī hain.\n- Yeh hadith **khāne ke ādāb** ('ādāb al-akl) sikhātī hai"," muslimān ko khāne ke kināron se khāne kā hukm detā hāi tāki **barakah** (ilāhi barkat) bāqi rahe aur khāne par nazil hotī rahay."""
"1867","Phir woh yeh kare: 'Bismillah.' Agar woh bhool jaye shuru mein, to woh yeh kare: 'Bismillah Fi Awwalihi Wa Akhirih (Us ke aurate us ke aakhri aur us ke awwal mein Allah ke naam se). \nJam e Tirmazi Hadees: 1858 Arabic Hadees: 1858"
"1868","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Shaitan ke paas ek zaiqa (taste) hai.\"""""
"1869","Abu Hurairah (Razi Allah Anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jo shab ko kisi ne haath mein (khushboo) lekar soya aur us par koi museebat aaye...\"""""
"1870","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Har muskir cheez Khamr hai.\"""""
"1871","**Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis shakhs ne Khamr (sharab) pee...\""**"""
"1872","Aap Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) say bt' kay baray myn swal kya gya tw aap (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \hr wh mshrab hram hay jw nshh aawr hw۔\"" [abw aysyٰ nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔]"""
"1873","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Har muskir cheez haraam hai.\"" Rawiya kehte hain ke is mauzoo par Umar (رضي الله عن) se bhi rivaayaat hain."""
"1874","Jabir bin ‘Abdullah (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \js chyz ky zyadh mqdar nshh aawr hw، as ky km mqdar nh hram ky jaty hay۔\"""""
"1875","Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Aisha (raziyaAllahu anha) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Har muskir cheez hai haram hai. Jo cheez ek faraq mein nashe ka sabab banaye woh haram hai.\"""""
"1876","Muhammad ibn Sahl ibn Askar al-Baghdādī aur Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman (raziyallāhu anhumā) ne riwāyat kihā kih ham dono ne kihā: ham se Yahyā ibn Hassān ne riwāyat kī, unho ne kihā: ham se Sulaymān ibn Bilāl ne riwāyat kī, unho ne Hishām ibn Urwah se riwāyat kī, unho ne apne wālid (Urwah) se riwāyat kī, unho ne Ā’ishah (raziyallāhu anhā) se riwāyat kihā kih Nabī ﷺ ne farmāyā: “Jis ghar mein khajūr (khormā) nahīṅ hotī, us ke bāshindā bhūke rahte haiṅ.”\n\n(Al-Tirmidhī) ne kihā: Is bāb mein Salmā (raziyallāhu anhā), jinheṅ Abū Rāfi’ kī bīvī thīṅ, kī riwāyat bhī hai.\n\nAbū Īsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne kihā: Ye hadīs hasan gharīb hai; is hadīs ko Hishām ibn Urwah kī taraf se is silsile ke siwā ham nahīṅ jānte. Unho ne kihā: “Maine al-Bukhārī se is hadīs ke bāre mein daryāft kihā, to unho ne farmāyā: ‘Mujhe Yahyā ibn Hassān ke siwā kisī aur kī taraf se is kī riwāyat nahīṅ ma’lūm hotī.’”"
"1877","Zadhan ne riwayat ki: \Maine Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ke haram farmaye hue bartanon ke baare mein poocha. Unhon ne humein tumhari zaban mein bataaya.\"""""
"1878","# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Jābir ibn 'Abdullāh** (raziyallāhu 'anhu) ne riwāyat kih Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu 'alayhi wa sallam) ne ek mubtalaā māhūs (jismānī bimārī se muta'aththir shakhs) kā haath pakar liyā, use apne sāth bartān (thālī) mein bithāyā, aur pharmāyā:\n\n**\Khāo: Allāh ke nām se"," Allāh par bharosā rakhte hue aur usī par tawakkul karte hue.\""**\n\n---\n\n**Abū 'Īsā** (Imām Tirmidhī) ne tafsīl se bayān farmāyā: Ye hadīs *gharīb* (nādir/infarādī) hāl mein hai. Is kī sanad sirf Yūnus ibn Muḥammad ke zariye se mālūm hotī hai jo al-Mufaḍḍal ibn Faḍālah se rawāyat karte hain. Unhon ne zikr farmāyā ke yahān mazkūr al-Mufaḍḍal ibn Faḍālah ek Baṣrī shaykh hain"," aur ek dūsrā al-Mufaḍḍal ibn Faḍālah Miṣrī shaykh hain jo is se ziyāda mu'tabar aur mashhūr hain. Is ke ilāwā Shu'bah ne ek māthūr hadīs riwāyat kī hai Ḥabīb ibn al-Shahīd se jo Ibn Buraydah se rawāyat karte hain ke Ibn 'Umar (raziyallāhu 'anhu) ne ek mubtalaā māhūs kā haath pakar liyā"," aur Shu'bah kī hadīs un ke nazdīk ziyāda mustanad aur aṣaḥḥ hai."""
"1879","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay kchh brtnwn kay astamal say mna frmaya tha۔ chnanchh ansar (rz all anhm) nay as kay slslay myn aap ﷺ say shkayt ky awr arz kya: \hmaray pas kwyy brtn nhyn rh jayay ga!\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""agr aysa hay tw phr an ka astamal krw\""\n\nrawy nay kha: as mwzwa pr abn msawd (rz all anh) say bhy rwaytyn hyn۔"""
"1880","Aisha (Razi Allahu Anha) ne riwayat farmaya: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke liye nabeez tayyar karte thay ek mashk mein jo upar se bandhi hoti thi aur uska ek chhota sa surakh tha. Hum subah ke waqt us mein nabeez tayyar karte thay.\"""""
"1881","Nu'man bin Bashir (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bay shk shrab (khmr) gndm say bnty hay۔\"""""
"1882","Hazrat Umar (Razi Allah unho) ne farmaya: \Beshak sharab (khamr) gehun se banti hai.\"" Aur unhon ne is Hadees ka zikr kiya."""
"1883","Hazrat Umar bin Al-Khattab (رضی اللہ عنہ) سے روایت ہے: \بے شک شراب (خمر) گیہوں سے بنتی ہے۔\"" [اس ذکر کے بعد]"""
"1884","Abu Kathir As-Suhaimi ne riwayat kiya ke unhone Abu Hurairah (razi) se sunaraha ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Khamr (madira) in dono darakhton (paudon) se aati hai: Khajoor ke darakht aur angoor ke bel se.\"" [Abu 'Eisa (ra) ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai. Abu Kathir As-Suhaimi Al-Ghubari hain."""
"1885","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nh pky hwyy khjwrwn awr nh tazh khjwrwn kw ml kr nbyz bnanay say mna frmaya۔ [abw aysyٰ nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔]"
"1886","Abu Sa'eed (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nh pkay hwyay khjwrwn awr pkay hwyay khjwrwn kw mlanay say mna frmaya۔"
"1887","Shu'bah bin Al-Hakam ne riwayat ki ke maine Ibn Abi Laila ko suna ke Hudhaifah (رضي الله عنه) ne paani maanga."
"1888","Qatadah ne riwayat ki hai ke Anas (رضي الله عنه) se: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne aadmi ke khade hone par peene se mana farmaya.\"" (Qatadah ne kaha:) to poochha gaya: \""Aur khana?\"" Unhon ne (Anas ne) kaha: \""Woh aur bhi bura hai.\"" [Abu Eisa ne kaha:] Ye Hadith Hasan Sahih hai."""
"1889","Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ki zindagi ke dauran chalte hue khaana khaate the.\"""""
"1890","Al-Jarud bin Al-'Ala' (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby akrm (ﷺ) nay khray hwyay pynay say mna frmaya۔ awr as bab myn abw sayd khdry (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt bhy mwjwd hay۔"
"1891","Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke: \Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Zamzam ka paani khade khade piya.\"" Unhon ne kaha ke is mazmoon par Ali (رضي الله عنهما) se bhi rivayatain hain."""
"1892","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne riwayat ki, unhone Hajjaj ibn Muhammad se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne humein ittela di ke Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne unhe ittela di ke 'Ata' ibn Yasar ne unhe ittela di ke Umm Salamah رضي الله عنها ne unhe ittela di ke unhone Rasoolullah ﷺ ke liye bhuna hua gosha-e-laham pesh kiya aur Aap ﷺ ne us mein se khaya. Phir Aap ﷺ namaz ke liye khade ho gaye, baghair wudū’ ke.\n\nUnhone kaha: Is bab mein Abdullah ibn al-Harith, al-Mughirah aur Abu Rafi' se bhi ahadith hain.\n\nAbu 'Isa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Yeh is silsile se hasan sahih gharib hadith hai."
"1893","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se kisi ko aisi qaayam na kare jaise oont peeta hai. Balke do ya teen ghoont pee le.\"""""
"1894","Salamah ibn Shabîb, Mahmûd ibn Ghaylân aur Ahmad ibn Ibrâhîm ad-Dâwarî ne hamârî taraf se riwâyat kî, unhon ne farmâyâ: Abû Usâmah ne hamârî taraf se riwâyat kî, unho ne Hishâm ibn Urwah se, unho ne apne wâlid se, unho ne Âishah (radiyallâhu anhâ) se riwâyat kî, unhôn ne farmâyâ: \Nabî (sallallâhu alaihi wa sallam) mîthây aur shahad ko bahut pasand karte the.\"" Ye hasan sahîh gharîb hadîs hâi. Is ko Alî ibn Muhsin ne bhi Hishâm ibn Urwah se riwâyat kî hâi"," aur is hadîs mein is se zyâda alfâz bhi hâin."""
"1895","Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ ne) pees mein phoonkne se mana’ farmaya. Ek shakhs ne kaha: \Agar bartan mein koi cheez tair rahi ho toh kya karein?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Usey nikal do (wo cheez phenk do).\"" Us shakhs ne kaha: \""Main ek hi saans mein nahi pee sakta.\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Phir bartan ko apni hont se door kar lo.\"" [Abu Eisa (رحمه"""
"1896","Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne bartan mein phoonkne se mana farmaya."
